{"id":"n87352-1-9","stage":3,"title":"확신 · 确信","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87352-1-9-1","ko":"승규는 시험에 붙을 거 같대?","zh":"承奎说好像能考上呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}},{"text":"시험에","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에","audio":"/audio/6e08c695baae36fe0f89.mp3"}},{"text":"붙을","meaning":"考上，通过","explanation":"붙다：考上，通过；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"붙다","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74181","senseId":"2","lemma":"붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙을","audio":"/audio/84716751f6c3489b3d28.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"같대?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같대","audio":"/audio/a5e45e8438e778ff33fc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"25c69080a9810c70","term":"붙다","zh":"考上，通过","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3",