in":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇다니까","audio":"/audio/8571200c2321a24d4706.mp3"}},{"text":"자신감은","meaning":"自信感，自信心","explanation":"자신감：自信感，自信心；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"자신감","audio":"/audio/8110dcdc8de786a98515.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24782","senseId":"1","lemma":"자신감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자신감은","audio":"/audio/f67754775d568a0e85fa.mp3"}},{"text":"있나","meaning":"能","explanation":"있다：能；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나","audio":"/audio/54242f507cd667676232.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"de6a945f1d04a264","term":"확신","zh":"确信，坚信，信心","audio":"/audio/de6a945f1d04a264ca6e.mp3","entryId":"87352","definition":"坚定地相信；或指这种想法。","pronunciation":["확씬"]},{"id":"d8eb940a7794fc46","term":"차다","zh":"充满、饱含（확신에 차다：充满信心）","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3","entryId":"37227","definition":"充满、饱含（확신에 차다：充满信心）","pronunciation":["차다"]},{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8110dcdc8de786a9","term":"자신감","zh":"自信感，自信心","au